  "body": "Third resource-audit step. Scale worker-slot capacity down as well as up when RUNNING bot count changes.\n\nBehavior:\n- target slot count remains min(RUNNING bots, configured workerCount)\n- surplus slots receive a graceful retirement request instead of Future.cancel(true)\n- an idle slot notices retirement within about one second\n- a slot that already claimed a task finishes that task and only then exits\n- browser cleanup stays on the owner worker thread\n- scale-up continues to recreate required capacity\n\nTests cover 10 -> 3, 3 -> 10, unchanged capacity, invalid counts, and prompt idle retirement.\n\nNo bot schedule intervals, offer/negotiation semantics, browser session persistence, market-stats or frontend behavior is changed.",
